===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*fak}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*faką||division, piece, part}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*pāǵe-||to nail, fasten}}.

Cognate with {{cog|ofs|fek}}, {{cog|osx|fak}} ({{cog|nl|vak}}), {{cog|goh|fah}} ({{cog|de|Fach}}), {{cog|la|pangō}}.

